.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-ssh 1  "oct-ssh " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-ssh \- Show a card\*(Aqs authentication key as an SSH public key
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct ssh\fR [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-card\fR] [\fB\-\-key\-only\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Show a card\*(Aqs authentication key as an SSH public key
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-card\fR \fI<card ident>\fR
Identifier of the card to use
.TP
\fB\-\-key\-only\fR
Only print the ssh public key
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
